{
  "spec": {
    "title": "Motion Path Module Level 1",
    "url": "https://drafts.csswg.org/motion-1/"
  },
  "algorithms": [
    {
      "name": "used offset distance",
      "href": "https://drafts.csswg.org/motion-1/#used-offset-distance",
      "html": "To determine the <dfn class=\"dfn-paneled\" data-dfn-type=\"dfn\" data-noexport=\"\" id=\"used-offset-distance\"><button class=\"dfn-panelbutton\" popovertarget=\"infopanel-for-used-offset-distance\">used offset distance</button></dfn><dialog class=\"dfn-panel\" id=\"infopanel-for-used-offset-distance\" popover=\"hint\" data-for=\"used-offset-distance\" aria-labelledby=\"infopaneltitle-for-used-offset-distance\"><span id=\"infopaneltitle-for-used-offset-distance\" style=\"display:none\">Info about the 'used offset distance'  reference.</span><a href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/motion-1/#used-offset-distance\" class=\"dfn-link\">#used-offset-distance</a><b>Referenced in:</b><ul><li><a href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/motion-1/#ref-for-used-offset-distance\">2.1.1. The ray() Function</a> </li><li><a href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/motion-1/#ref-for-used-offset-distance%E2%91%A0\">2.2.1. Calculating the computed distance along a path</a> <a href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/motion-1/#ref-for-used-offset-distance%E2%91%A1\">(2)</a> <a href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/motion-1/#ref-for-used-offset-distance%E2%91%A2\">(3)</a> <a href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/motion-1/#ref-for-used-offset-distance%E2%91%A3\">(4)</a> <a href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/motion-1/#ref-for-used-offset-distance%E2%91%A4\">(5)</a> </li></ul><b>Possible linking syntaxes:</b><ul><li><div class=\"link-item\"><button class=\"copy-icon\" title=\"Copy\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\"><span class=\"icon\"></span></button><span>[=used offset distance=]</span></div></li><li><div class=\"link-item\"><button class=\"copy-icon\" title=\"Copy\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\"><span class=\"icon\"></span></button><span>[=/used offset distance=]</span></div></li></ul></dialog> for a given <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/motion-1/#offset-path\" id=\"ref-for-offset-path②③\">offset path</a> and <dfn class=\"dfn-paneled\" data-dfn-type=\"dfn\" data-noexport=\"\" id=\"offset-distance\"><button class=\"dfn-panelbutton\" popovertarget=\"infopanel-for-offset-distance\">offset distance</button></dfn><dialog class=\"dfn-panel\" id=\"infopanel-for-offset-distance\" popover=\"hint\" data-for=\"offset-distance\" aria-labelledby=\"infopaneltitle-for-offset-distance\"><span id=\"infopaneltitle-for-offset-distance\" style=\"display:none\">Info about the 'offset distance'  reference.</span><a href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/motion-1/#offset-distance\" class=\"dfn-link\">#offset-distance</a><b>Referenced in:</b><ul><li><a href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/motion-1/#ref-for-offset-distance\">2.2.1. Calculating the computed distance along a path</a> <a href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/motion-1/#ref-for-offset-distance%E2%91%A0\">(2)</a> <a href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/motion-1/#ref-for-offset-distance%E2%91%A1\">(3)</a> <a href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/motion-1/#ref-for-offset-distance%E2%91%A2\">(4)</a> <a href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/motion-1/#ref-for-offset-distance%E2%91%A3\">(5)</a> </li></ul><b>Possible linking syntaxes:</b><ul><li><div class=\"link-item\"><button class=\"copy-icon\" title=\"Copy\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\"><span class=\"icon\"></span></button><span>[=offset distance=]</span></div></li><li><div class=\"link-item\"><button class=\"copy-icon\" title=\"Copy\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\"><span class=\"icon\"></span></button><span>[=/offset distance=]</span></div></li></ul></dialog>:",
      "rationale": "let",
      "steps": [
        {
          "html": "<p>Let the <dfn class=\"dfn-paneled\" data-dfn-type=\"dfn\" data-noexport=\"\" id=\"total-length\"><button class=\"dfn-panelbutton\" popovertarget=\"infopanel-for-total-length\">total length</button></dfn><dialog class=\"dfn-panel\" id=\"infopanel-for-total-length\" popover=\"hint\" data-for=\"total-length\" aria-labelledby=\"infopaneltitle-for-total-length\"><span id=\"infopaneltitle-for-total-length\" style=\"display:none\">Info about the 'total length'  reference.</span><a href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/motion-1/#total-length\" class=\"dfn-link\">#total-length</a><b>Referenced in:</b><ul><li><a href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/motion-1/#ref-for-total-length\">2.2.1. Calculating the computed distance along a path</a> </li></ul><b>Possible linking syntaxes:</b><ul><li><div class=\"link-item\"><button class=\"copy-icon\" title=\"Copy\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\"><span class=\"icon\"></span></button><span>[=total length=]</span></div></li><li><div class=\"link-item\"><button class=\"copy-icon\" title=\"Copy\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\"><span class=\"icon\"></span></button><span>[=/total length=]</span></div></li></ul></dialog> be the total length of <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/motion-1/#offset-path\" id=\"ref-for-offset-path②④\">offset path</a> with all sub-paths.</p>"
        },
        {
          "html": "<p>Convert <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/motion-1/#offset-distance\" id=\"ref-for-offset-distance\">offset distance</a> to pixels, with 100% being converted to <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/motion-1/#total-length\" id=\"ref-for-total-length\">total length</a>.</p>"
        },
        {
          "html": "<dl class=\"switch\">\n      <dt data-md=\"\">If <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/motion-1/#offset-path\" id=\"ref-for-offset-path②⑤\">offset path</a> is an unbounded ray:\n      </dt><dd data-md=\"\">\n       <p>Let <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/motion-1/#used-offset-distance\" id=\"ref-for-used-offset-distance①\">used offset distance</a> be equal to <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/motion-1/#offset-distance\" id=\"ref-for-offset-distance①\">offset distance</a>.</p>\n      </dd><dt data-md=\"\">Otherwise if <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/motion-1/#offset-path\" id=\"ref-for-offset-path②⑥\">offset path</a> is an <a class=\"css production\" data-link-type=\"type\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-values-4/#angle-value\" id=\"ref-for-angle-value⑧\" title=\"Expands to: deg | grad | rad | turn\">&lt;angle&gt;</a> path with contain:\n      </dt><dd data-md=\"\">\n       <p>Let <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/motion-1/#used-offset-distance\" id=\"ref-for-used-offset-distance②\">used offset distance</a> be equal to <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/motion-1/#offset-distance\" id=\"ref-for-offset-distance②\">offset distance</a>, clamped so that the box lies entirely within the path.</p>\n      </dd><dt data-md=\"\">If <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/motion-1/#offset-path\" id=\"ref-for-offset-path②⑦\">offset path</a> is any other unclosed interval:\n      </dt><dd data-md=\"\">\n       <p>Let <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/motion-1/#used-offset-distance\" id=\"ref-for-used-offset-distance③\">used offset distance</a> be equal to <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/motion-1/#offset-distance\" id=\"ref-for-offset-distance③\">offset distance</a> clamped by 0 and the total length of the path.</p>\n      </dd><dt data-md=\"\">Otherwise <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/motion-1/#offset-path\" id=\"ref-for-offset-path②⑧\">offset path</a> is a closed loop:\n      </dt><dd data-md=\"\">\n       <p>Let <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/motion-1/#used-offset-distance\" id=\"ref-for-used-offset-distance④\">used offset distance</a> be equal to <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/motion-1/#offset-distance\" id=\"ref-for-offset-distance④\">offset distance</a> modulo the total length of the path. If the total length of the path is 0, <span id=\"ref-for-used-offset-distance⑤\">used offset distance</span> is also 0.</p>\n       \n     </dd></dl>",
          "rationale": ".switch",
          "steps": [
            {
              "operation": "switch",
              "steps": [
                {
                  "case": "If offset path is an unbounded ray:",
                  "html": "<p>Let <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/motion-1/#used-offset-distance\" id=\"ref-for-used-offset-distance①\">used offset distance</a> be equal to <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/motion-1/#offset-distance\" id=\"ref-for-offset-distance①\">offset distance</a>.</p>"
                },
                {
                  "case": "Otherwise if offset path is an <angle> path with contain:",
                  "html": "<p>Let <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/motion-1/#used-offset-distance\" id=\"ref-for-used-offset-distance②\">used offset distance</a> be equal to <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/motion-1/#offset-distance\" id=\"ref-for-offset-distance②\">offset distance</a>, clamped so that the box lies entirely within the path.</p>"
                },
                {
                  "case": "If offset path is any other unclosed interval:",
                  "html": "<p>Let <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/motion-1/#used-offset-distance\" id=\"ref-for-used-offset-distance③\">used offset distance</a> be equal to <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/motion-1/#offset-distance\" id=\"ref-for-offset-distance③\">offset distance</a> clamped by 0 and the total length of the path.</p>"
                },
                {
                  "case": "Otherwise offset path is a closed loop:",
                  "html": "<p>Let <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/motion-1/#used-offset-distance\" id=\"ref-for-used-offset-distance④\">used offset distance</a> be equal to <a data-link-type=\"dfn\" href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/motion-1/#offset-distance\" id=\"ref-for-offset-distance④\">offset distance</a> modulo the total length of the path. If the total length of the path is 0, <span id=\"ref-for-used-offset-distance⑤\">used offset distance</span> is also 0.</p>"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}